u:p006","quote":"僧孺坐免官，久之不調。友人廬江何炯猶爲王府記室，乃致書於炯，以見其意。曰：","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p006:m0015"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按本見證原職名及其所屬人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-nanshi059-wangsengru-m5-150","person_id":"d97_63f_52o","title":"記室","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanshi059-wangsengru-m5-150:a","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0144","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005","surface":"記室","start":150,"end":152}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-059","source_id":"s-nanshi-059-wangsengru-ws1553912","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005","quote":"時武帝制春景明志詩五百字，敕沈約以下辭人同作，帝以僧孺為工。曆少府卿，尚書吏部郎，參大選，請謁不行。出為仁威南康王長史、蘭陵太守，行府、州、國事。初，帝問僧孺妾媵之數，對曰：「臣室無傾視。」及在南徐州，友人以妾寓之，行還，妾遂懷孕。為王典簽湯道湣所糾，逮詣南司，坐免官，久之不調。友人廬江何炯猶為王府記室，僧孺乃與炯書以見其意。後為安成王參軍事，鎮右中記室參軍。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0144"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按本見證原職名及其所屬人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:r0011","surface":"子","start":11,"end":12,"person_id":"d97_63f_52o","referent_role":"addressee","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007","quote":"近別之後，將隔暄寒，思子爲勞，未能忘弭。昔李叟入秦，梁生適越，猶懷悵恨，且或吟謠；況歧路之日，將離嚴網，辭無可憐，罪有不測。蓋畫地刻木，昔人所惡，叢棘旣累，於何可聞，所以握手戀戀，離別珍重。弟愛同鄒季，淫淫承睫，吾猶復抗手分背，羞學婦人。素鐘肇節，金飆戒序，起居無恙，動靜履宜。子雲筆札，元瑜書記，信用旣然，可樂爲甚。且使目明，能祛首疾。甚善甚善。","note":"依原有文體、發言者、受話人、王府或本傳前後文。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru","book_id":"b-liangshu-033","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-033-wangsengru-ws1514481"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:r0095","surface":"弟","start":95,"end":96,"person_id":"d97_63f_52o","referent_role":"addressee","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007","quote":"近別之後，將隔暄寒，思子爲勞，未能忘弭。昔李叟入秦，梁生適越，猶懷悵恨，且或吟謠；況歧路之日，將離嚴網，辭無可憐，罪有不測。蓋畫地刻木，昔人所惡，叢棘旣累，於何可聞，所以握手戀戀，離別珍重。弟愛同鄒季，淫淫承睫，吾猶復抗手分背，羞學婦人。素鐘肇節，金飆戒序，起居無恙，動靜履宜。子雲筆札，元瑜書記，信用旣然，可樂爲甚。且使目明，能祛首疾。甚善甚善。","note":"依原有文體、發言者、受話人、王府或本傳前後文。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru","book_id":"b-liangshu-033","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-033-wangsengru-ws1514481"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p011:r0281","surface":"何生","start":281,"end":283,"person_id":"d97_63f_52o","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p011","quote":"蓋先貴後賤，古富今貧，季倫所以發此哀音，雍門所以和其悲曲。又迫以嚴秋殺氣，具物多悲，長夜輾轉，百憂俱至。況復霜銷草色，風搖樹影。寒蟲夕叫，合輕重而同悲；秋葉晚傷，雜黃紫而俱墜。蜘蛛絡幕，熠耀爭飛，故無車轍馬聲，何聞鳴雞吠犬。俯眉事妻子，舉手謝賓遊。方與飛走爲鄰，永用蓬蒿自沒。愾其長息，忽不覺生之爲重。素無一廛之田，而有數口之累。豈曰匏而不食，方當長爲傭保，糊口寄身，溘死溝渠，以實螻蟻。悲夫！豈復得與二三士友，抱接膝之歡，履足差肩，摛綺縠之清文，談希微之道德。唯吳馮之遇夏馥，范式之值孔嵩，愍其留賃，憐此行乞耳。儻不以垢累，時存寸札，則雖先犬馬，猶松喬焉。去矣何生，高樹芳烈。裁書代面，筆淚俱下。","note":"依原有文體、發言者、受話人、王府或本傳前後文。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru","book_id":"b-liangshu-033","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-033-wangsengru-ws1514481"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p006","text":"僧孺坐免官，久之不調。友人廬江何炯猶爲王府記室，乃致書於炯，以見其意。曰：","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p006:m0000","surface":"僧孺","start":0,"end":2,"person_id":"59d_72d_924_AAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p006:m0015","surface":"何炯","start":15,"end":17,"person_id":"d97_63f_52o","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p006:m0028","surface":"炯","start":28,"end":29,"person_id":"d97_63f_52o","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1514481,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":23,"last_line":23,"line_start":2,"line_end":39,"raw_start":1493,"raw_end":1530,"raw_character_offsets":[1493,1494,1495,1496,1497,1498,1499,1500,1501,1502,1503,1504,1505,1506,1507,1508,1509,1510,1511,1512,1513,1514,1515,1516,1517,1518,1519,1520,1521,1522,1523,1524,1525,1526,1527,1528,1529],"projection_sha256":"799fdfdd51d872c4d0315caa62f9465a3374f773baa21634fb7f2a6b8bca3e24","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru","book_id":"b-liangshu-033","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-033-wangsengru-ws1514481"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007","text":"近別之後，將隔暄寒，思子爲勞，未能忘弭。昔李叟入秦，梁生適越，猶懷悵恨，且或吟謠；況歧路之日，將離嚴網，辭無可憐，罪有不測。蓋畫地刻木，昔人所惡，叢棘旣累，於何可聞，所以握手戀戀，離別珍重。弟愛同鄒季，淫淫承睫，吾猶復抗手分背，羞學婦人。素鐘肇節，金飆戒序，起居無恙，動靜履宜。子雲筆札，元瑜書記，信用旣然，可樂爲甚。且使目明，能祛首疾。甚善甚善。","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0021","surface":"李叟","start":21,"end":23,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"送別所用入秦典，此句未明其名。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0026","surface":"梁生","start":26,"end":28,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"適越故事，未僅憑梁姓擬名。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0098","surface":"鄒季","start":98,"end":100,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"書稱弟愛同鄒季，用於比擬，非何炯為僧孺親弟之據。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0139","surface":"子雲","start":139,"end":141,"person_id":"5bd_a4e_ad6","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0144","surface":"元瑜","start":144,"end":146,"person_id":"pkw_eqh_gnj","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1514481,"source_layer":"received_biography","first