u-033-wangsengru:p011:m0232","surface":"吳馮","start":232,"end":234,"person_id":"hzq_i8y_lac","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p011:m0236","surface":"夏馥","start":236,"end":238,"person_id":"z6y_bbe_hx7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p011:m0239","surface":"范式","start":239,"end":241,"person_id":"cm9_2s9_s5t","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p011:m0243","surface":"孔嵩","start":243,"end":245,"person_id":"3w5_rin_3cm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1514481,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":33,"last_line":33,"line_start":3,"line_end":302,"raw_start":2677,"raw_end":2976,"raw_character_offsets":[2677,2678,2679,2680,2681,2682,2683,2684,2685,2686,2687,2688,2689,2690,2691,2692,2693,2694,2695,2696,2697,2698,2699,2700,2701,2702,2703,2704,2705,2706,2707,2708,2709,2710,2711,2712,2713,2714,2715,2716,2717,2718,2719,2720,2721,2722,2723,2724,2725,2726,2727,2728,2729,2730,2731,2732,2733,2734,2735,2736,2737,2738,2739,2740,2741,2742,2743,2744,2745,2746,2747,2748,2749,2750,2751,2752,2753,2754,2755,2756,2757,2758,2759,2760,2761,2762,2763,2764,2765,2766,2767,2768,2769,2770,2771,2772,2773,2774,2775,2776,2777,2778,2779,2780,2781,2782,2783,2784,2785,2786,2787,2788,2789,2790,2791,2792,2793,2794,2795,2796,2797,2798,2799,2800,2801,2802,2803,2804,2805,2806,2807,2808,2809,2810,2811,2812,2813,2814,2815,2816,2817,2818,2819,2820,2821,2822,2823,2824,2825,2826,2827,2828,2829,2830,2831,2832,2833,2834,2835,2836,2837,2838,2839,2840,2841,2842,2843,2844,2845,2846,2847,2848,2849,2850,2851,2852,2853,2854,2855,2856,2857,2858,2859,2860,2861,2862,2863,2864,2865,2866,2867,2868,2869,2870,2871,2872,2873,2874,2875,2876,2877,2878,2879,2880,2881,2882,2883,2884,2885,2886,2887,2888,2889,2890,2891,2892,2893,2894,2895,2896,2897,2898,2899,2900,2901,2902,2903,2904,2905,2906,2907,2908,2909,2910,2911,2912,2913,2914,2915,2916,2917,2918,2919,2920,2921,2922,2923,2924,2925,2926,2927,2928,2929,2930,2931,2932,2933,2934,2935,2936,2937,2938,2939,2940,2941,2942,2943,2944,2945,2946,2947,2948,2949,2950,2951,2952,2953,2954,2955,2956,2957,2958,2959,2960,2961,2962,2963,2964,2965,2966,2967,2968,2969,2970,2971,2972,2973,2974,2975],"projection_sha256":"6aa9c5d59c95a3af9b17c2e79fd668d2a7d3be60f2835a9bd04930209ce25bf8","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru","book_id":"b-liangshu-033","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-033-wangsengru-ws1514481"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005","text":"時武帝制春景明志詩五百字，敕沈約以下辭人同作，帝以僧孺為工。曆少府卿，尚書吏部郎，參大選，請謁不行。出為仁威南康王長史、蘭陵太守，行府、州、國事。初，帝問僧孺妾媵之數，對曰：「臣室無傾視。」及在南徐州，友人以妾寓之，行還，妾遂懷孕。為王典簽湯道湣所糾，逮詣南司，坐免官，久之不調。友人廬江何炯猶為王府記室，僧孺乃與炯書以見其意。後為安成王參軍事，鎮右中記室參軍。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0014","surface":"沈約","start":14,"end":16,"person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0025","surface":"僧孺","start":25,"end":27,"person_id":"59d_72d_924_AAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0077","surface":"僧孺","start":77,"end":79,"person_id":"59d_72d_924_AAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0120","surface":"湯道湣","start":120,"end":123,"person_id":"igj_rq2_zhf","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0144","surface":"何炯","start":144,"end":146,"person_id":"d97_63f_52o","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsen